{"unit_id":"FelixJiashengFu__dsh-haoba-mode#feature-1","repo":"FelixJiashengFu/dsh-haoba-mode","commit":"43e24b093a2de7748010fac784340aad89eb0f08","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"豪霸模式的功能「提高模型推理与输出预算」：开启后，它查询当前 provider 和 model 的能力，把推理档位设为模型声明的最高档，并将 maxTokens 提高到默认最大值。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:138-165"]}
{"unit_id":"FelixJiashengFu__dsh-haoba-mode#feature-2","repo":"FelixJiashengFu/dsh-haoba-mode","commit":"43e24b093a2de7748010fac784340aad89eb0f08","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"豪霸模式的功能「输入框旁的模式开关」：网页聊天输入框旁提供金色开关，点击后通过本机状态路由启用或关闭模式，并展示忙碌和错误状态。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:216-299","lib/client.js:321-328","lib/index.js:313-335"]}
{"unit_id":"FelixJiashengFu__dsh-haoba-mode#feature-3","repo":"FelixJiashengFu/dsh-haoba-mode","commit":"43e24b093a2de7748010fac784340aad89eb0f08","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"豪霸模式的功能「保存和恢复开关状态」：切换模式时把 enabled 状态写入用户目录下的 .dsh/haoba-mode.json，插件启动时读取并恢复已开启状态。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:247-269","lib/index.js:340-351"]}
{"unit_id":"FelixJiashengFu__dsh-haoba-mode#feature-4","repo":"FelixJiashengFu/dsh-haoba-mode","commit":"43e24b093a2de7748010fac784340aad89eb0f08","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"豪霸模式的功能「注入工作纪律提示」：开启后向系统提示注册一段固定的工作提示，关闭时移除该提示；若提示服务暂不可用，会记录状态错误。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:167-195","lib/prompt.js:11-22"]}
